  "title": "Perform Auto-Save on Demand [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "オートセーブを任意に実行【RPGツクールMZプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "3df092d38b07c764e1afbd4e126012ff1f43931d10e5c41d783ec6097d7dd6d0",
      "translation": "Perform Auto-Save on Demand [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "3df092d38b07c764e1afbd4e126012ff1f43931d10e5c41d783ec6097d7dd6d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "オートセーブを任意に実行します。",
      "sourceHash": "6da6eb151ff888e597e41f44e2c190ca9af0ebdd3897321eefdeb72caa20af18",
      "translation": "Perform auto-saves on demand.",
      "contextHash": "6da6eb151ff888e597e41f44e2c190ca9af0ebdd3897321eefdeb72caa20af18"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ＲＰＧツクールＭＺのオートセーブ機能は場所移動や戦闘後に実行されますが、作品によってはそれ以外のタイミングで実行したいこともあるかと思います。",
      "sourceHash": "2b6d361aa80df860baff7bb888427003ede21da15b9f3291260069cb84635e87",
      "translation": "RPG Maker MZ's auto-save feature runs when transferring locations and after battles, but depending on the game, you may want it to run at other times as well.",
      "contextHash": "2b6d361aa80df860baff7bb888427003ede21da15b9f3291260069cb84635e87"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "このプラグインでは開発者の好みのタイミングで、オートセーブできるように機能を提供します。",
      "sourceHash": "ccde6a484c5f7751cac9a9213862e9e775082286678dc05794484471219d0049",
      "translation": "This plugin allows you to perform auto-saves at timings of your choosing.",
      "contextHash": "ccde6a484c5f7751cac9a9213862e9e775082286678dc05794484471219d0049"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Enable the feature from the RPG Maker plugin manager.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＺ専用です。",
      "sourceHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d",
      "translation": "※This plugin is for MZ only.",
      "contextHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NRP_AutoSave.js",
      "sourceHash": "3a6e2ee3ea5a21a22277edafe3aaa8acddda29c4774fe901281bb574a69c330b",
      "translation": "NRP_AutoSave.js ",
      "contextHash": "98bad9926d30c15caa1c76094a89e6f6a6981a9db6ebb7826b24379f5c1da586"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ver1.01（2025/04/03）",
      "sourceHash": "7178917ef0fd3eea64801409794c3683c365a334812504a8551d0edcdf1170bf",
      "translation": "ver1.01 (2025/04/03) ",
      "contextHash": "98bad9926d30c15caa1c76094a89e6f6a6981a9db6ebb7826b24379f5c1da586"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-003",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "更新履歴（History）",
      "sourceHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7",
      "translation": "Changelog (History)",
      "contextHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-004",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2025/04/03（ver1.01）",
      "sourceHash": "ada501f2c80fefccee84ab0669d3f96b6ce70605295aa8294739b8afd09155a3",
      "translation": "2025/04/03 (ver1.01) ",
      "contextHash": "ada501f2c80fefccee84ab0669d3f96b6ce70605295aa8294739b8afd09155a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "プラグインコマンドによるオートセーブがロード時に再実行されてしまう不具合を修正。",
      "sourceHash": "4c2729688f31136178db901c2fc833a354aa1b7aaabce40079c941527bc4cf21",
      "translation": "Fixed a bug that caused auto-saves performed via plugin commands to run again when loading.",
      "contextHash": "4c2729688f31136178db901c2fc833a354aa1b7aaabce40079c941527bc4cf21"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2024/04/28（ver1.00）",
      "sourceHash": "c93580c64280e4e506de16d57a44ca353c17488fb61e699fe052e145894d97b2",
      "translation": "2024/04/28 (ver1.00) ",
      "contextHash": "c93580c64280e4e506de16d57a44ca353c17488fb61e699fe052e145894d97b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-002",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Released!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "使用方法（Usage）",
      "sourceHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9",
      "translation": "Usage (Usage)",
      "contextHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "プラグインコマンドを呼び出せば、オートセーブを実行できます。",
      "sourceHash": "4b9ce1108385268f34e14e7ccaa3e770b35f92b68fc12e3fe948e3b0ec471f16",
      "translation": "You can perform an auto-save by calling the plugin command.",
      "contextHash": "4b9ce1108385268f34e14e7ccaa3e770b35f92b68fc12e3fe948e3b0ec471f16"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "場所移動や戦闘でのオートセーブは、プラグインパラメータで無効にすることができます。",
      "sourceHash": "72c18705d545c346b6c80a2689dd8bfa7189d64eb2d0036e9f22d0f238c83ff1",
      "translation": "Auto-saves when transferring locations and after battles can be disabled using plugin parameters.",
      "contextHash": "72c18705d545c346b6c80a2689dd8bfa7189d64eb2d0036e9f22d0f238c83ff1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、システム１の「オートセーブを有効化」はオンにしておいてください。",
      "sourceHash": "a36402b569f226077496a57add0142399a439c3d66538b1be29597c8a09555c2",
      "translation": "Be sure to leave “Enable Autosave” in System 1 turned on.",
      "contextHash": "a36402b569f226077496a57add0142399a439c3d66538b1be29597c8a09555c2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "そうしないと、ロード画面にオートセーブのファイルが表示されません。",
      "sourceHash": "b9fe3ee7088292f82f0f148a17a8190ebbff77bea3860fae5d04589f6a3d7a1a",
      "translation": "Otherwise, the auto-save file will not appear on the load screen.",
      "contextHash": "b9fe3ee7088292f82f0f148a17a8190ebbff77bea3860fae5d04589f6a3d7a1a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "場所移動時のセーブを無効（DisabledTransferSave）",
      "sourceHash": "15585e225959f2523edfbc13309d551373a89e01a6d2e2dc19f7782162afdea8",
      "translation": "Disable Saving When Transferring Locations (DisabledTransferSave)",
      "contextHash": "15585e225959f2523edfbc13309d551373a89e01a6d2e2dc19f7782162afdea8"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "場所移動後のオートセーブ機能を無効化します。",
      "sourceHash": "6a45cb8eeabb9fd056451ab388f29ba5a39fc22f1d57bd7b2601050459a4c78a",
      "translation": "Disables auto-saving after transferring locations.",
      "contextHash": "6a45cb8eeabb9fd056451ab388f29ba5a39fc22f1d57bd7b2601050459a4c78a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "戦闘時のセーブを無効（DisabledBattleSave）",
      "sourceHash": "d758c4cfd0b18673c2cc4ba68823e0ae26b4186ca9d6c46233b287f56b32b835",
      "translation": "Disable Saving After Battle (DisabledBattleSave)",
      "contextHash": "d758c4cfd0b18673c2cc4ba68823e0ae26b4186ca9d6c46233b287f56b32b835"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "戦闘終了後のオートセーブ機能を無効化します。",
      "sourceHash": "70208357268995f08689fbd0d83024cb9685ada81055c21c8bd047c44dffe7e8",
      "translation": "Disables auto-saving after battles.",
      "contextHash": "70208357268995f08689fbd0d83024cb9685ada81055c21c8bd047c44dffe7e8"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "オートセーブ無効スイッチ（DisabledSwitch）",
      "sourceHash": "6313a93964578cd8b3020b259ae4bb826273f269af9fd3d3faca91348019923b",
      "translation": "Auto-Save Disabled Switch (DisabledSwitch)",
      "contextHash": "6313a93964578cd8b3020b259ae4bb826273f269af9fd3d3faca91348019923b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "スイッチがオンの場合はオートセーブを無効化します。",
      "sourceHash": "fc0cde5b5d86de1e85c78477ba4e2c21395b9be7dafe2bc296dfd6ecda497eee",
      "translation": "Disables auto-saving when the switch is on.",
      "contextHash": "fc0cde5b5d86de1e85c78477ba4e2c21395b9be7dafe2bc296dfd6ecda497eee"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "場所移動時、戦闘時のみが対象です。",
      "sourceHash": "f5a687ad992c3c0a9caf752d2eb2561e5047262d143741e0081914aebff96930",
      "translation": "This applies only when transferring locations and after battles.",
      "contextHash": "f5a687ad992c3c0a9caf752d2eb2561e5047262d143741e0081914aebff96930"
    }
  ],
